\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-180\li180\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. \cf0 Jesus, perfect intercessor,
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0 We know You are close at hand
\par You transform the sorrow of death
\par Into the joy of heaven.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Let's remember Your judgement day.
\par And blot all our sins away
\par For Thou did rescue us from sin
\par Out of compassion and love.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  2.  'Tis grace that shall keep us strengthened
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 And enable us withdraw
\par Out of the troubles of this world,
\par And into Your liberty.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par We shall cast away fear and fright,
\par Out of all our daily lives,
\par And then we no longer shall face
\par \pard    Shame and disgrace in our lives.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

